& \overset{\text{J-S}}{\ge} \frac{-O(M)+0.99M \sqrt{\frac{M+1}2 \log \frac{M+1}2 }}{1.01 M \log M} 
&=O \left(\sqrt{\frac{M}{\log M}} \right)-O \left(\frac1 {\log M} \right)
\end{align*} Now let  $M$  be large enough that the lower bound  $\ge 10^6$  and we win.

