Let  $O$  be the midpoint of  $\overline{AB}$ , and let  $M$  be the midpoint of  $\overline{PQ}$ . Note that
\begin{align*}
\angle CPD = 180^{\circ} - \angle BPD = 90^{\circ} = 180^{\circ} - \angle AQD = \angle CQD,
\end{align*}
so  $(CPDQ)$  is cyclic. Furthermore,
