so  $(CODQ)$  is cyclic. Now, note that 
\begin{align*}
\angle FCO &= \angle FPO 
&= \angle FPQ + \angle QPO 
&= \angle EPM + \angle QCO 
&= \angle EQM + \angle PCO 
&= \angle CQP + \angle PQO 
&= \angle CQO 
&= \angle CFO,
