&= \dfrac{CE^2}{CD^2} = \dfrac{CQ^2}{CD^2} = \dfrac{\text{Pow}(C, (PFXQ))}{\text{Pow}(C , (GFXD))}
\end{align*}
which, by the Forgotten Coaxiality Lemma, means that  $AFXC$  is cyclic.

