<span style="color:#f00">**claim**</span>:  $AIDG$  is cyclic.
<span style="color:#38761D">**proof**</span>:

\begin{align*} 
\angle AIG&=180^{\circ} -\angle GCF 
 &=180^\circ - \angle GBI_A 
