and I tried to utilize  $1$  must occuring as a  $\textbf{minimal difference}$  (i.e. there exists a  $d_i = F_2$ ; or  $R_1 = 2$ , by the notation @Solution) and induct in some way (possibly reduce  $F_i$  to  $F_{i-1}$ ?) but to no avail. 

