\[ B_1,B_2,\ldots,B_{2k}; \ B_{i+1} \geq B_i+B_{i-1} \]
are, they cannot fit within the bounds of  $d_i+d_{i+1}+\ldots+d_j$ . (This will turn up as an alternative Solution after the test) 

