\end{align*}
Particularly the root of the quadratic factor is a size contradiction, since if  $0 < a < p$  is a root of  $x^2 + v$ , then  $p-a$  is the only other positive root smaller than  $p$ , contradiction.

The answer is all  $\boxed{\text{s composite}}$ . Work modulo  $s$ . We require 
