Thus,  $s \mid (cd-ab)(a+b)$  and  $s \mid (cd-ab)(c+d)$ . It would be nice for the conditions to be equivalent to finding  $a$ ,  $b$ ,  $c$ , and  $d$  with  $ab=cd$ .</details>

